# Plugins

Org features (payment methods, tax, shipping, CRM, widgets) go in `src/Plugins/Nop.Plugin.{Group}.{Name}/`.

- Keep `plugin.json` in sync: `SystemName`, `FileName`, `SupportedVersions`.
- Payment methods subclass `BasePlugin` and implement `IPaymentMethod` (see `Nop.Plugin.Payments.CheckMoneyOrder`).
- Settings: a `*Settings` class plus `ISettingService`. Do not hard-code gateway credentials.
- Register views/components the same way neighboring plugins do. Do not reach into `Nop.Web` internals if a plugin extension point exists.
- Install/uninstall must add and remove locale resources and settings.

Do not copy a plugin and leave the original `SystemName`. Colliding system names break `IPluginManager` load.
